# Build context for ci/validate.Dockerfile only. Kaniko (v1.23.2, the
# in-cluster repo-build executor) and BuildKit read <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in place of the root .dockerignore. The root file stays untouched because
# path impact rebuilds every registered image when it changes.
#
# Admit only the Dockerfile's two COPY inputs: .git/HEAD (the source-revision
# fallback) and the vendored PGDG signing key. Re-include each parent directory
# before its file: Kaniko does not restore a file inside a directory that is
# still excluded (see the db/ block in the root .dockerignore).
*
!.git
.git/*
!.git/HEAD
!db
db/*
!db/qualification
db/qualification/*
!db/qualification/pgdg-ACCC4CF8.asc
